<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.relay.fm/intentional/7">On this episode of <em>Intentional AI</em></a>, Chris and I talk about building your own iPhone app now that the robot writes the code. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Chris built a productivity super app for himself and his assistant, starting with a feature list he wrote on paper. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I talk about my Vestaboard app, which I built after the official one stalled and whose code I have never once looked at. We also get into token budgets, since none of this is free.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Making the perfect app for yourself is a weekend project now, but the app business is still a hard business. We also get into that.</p>



